1
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,000
[water splashes]

2
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:10,000
[Killua] Wait. "ika" means squid,

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:13,000
And you're an octopus, aren't you?

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,000
[Ikalgo sputters]

5
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:23,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

6
00:00:50,000 --> 00:00:54,000
[singer singing in English]

7
00:00:54,000 --> 00:00:56,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

8
00:00:56,000 --> 00:01:00,000
[singer singing in English]

9
00:01:18,000 --> 00:01:21,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

10
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:48,000
[narrator] Assassins attack
as Gon and Killua split up

11
00:01:48,000 --> 00:01:50,000
to stop the selection process.

12
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:55,000
One of them is Ikalgo,
an octopus-type chimera ant.

13
00:02:11,000 --> 00:02:12,000
[yells]

14
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,000
Long time, no see, huh?

15
00:02:23,000 --> 00:02:25,000
[chuckles]

16
00:02:37,000 --> 00:02:39,000
Don't tell me you can't swim.

17
00:02:39,000 --> 00:02:42,000
Uh, oh, uh, well--

18
00:02:53,000 --> 00:02:55,000
If you went in there
with those wounds,

19
00:02:55,000 --> 00:02:58,000
they'd tear you to shreds
in no time at all. Am I wrong?

20
00:02:58,000 --> 00:03:00,000
Uh, well, I don't think

21
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:03,000
I would have put it that way exactly,
but I suppose, uh--

22
00:03:03,000 --> 00:03:04,000
-[Flutter] Ikalgo!
-[gasps]

23
00:03:04,000 --> 00:03:05,000
Did you finish off the kid?

24
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:08,000
Not quite yet. We're still fighting.

25
00:03:08,000 --> 00:03:10,000
Eh? Wait. Who are you talking to?

26
00:03:10,000 --> 00:03:13,000
[shrieks] I screwed up!

27
00:03:13,000 --> 00:03:15,000
Oh, that's right.

28
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:17,000
You guys can communicate
telepathically.

29
00:03:17,000 --> 00:03:21,000
Your boss, he's the guy
who was flying over me, wasn't he?

30
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,000
Now hold on.
I can see why you might think--

31
00:03:23,000 --> 00:03:25,000
-[Flutter] Hey! Ikalgo!
-That's what I was doing--

32
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:37,000
I'm not going to send
my satellite dragonflies,

33
00:03:37,000 --> 00:03:41,000
because if the enemy sees them
flying about inside the cave,

34
00:03:41,000 --> 00:03:43,000
they will get suspicious.

35
00:03:43,000 --> 00:03:45,000
Okay, so let's make a deal.

36
00:03:51,000 --> 00:03:53,000
I'll give you ten seconds.

37
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:55,000
[gasps]

38
00:04:07,000 --> 00:04:09,000
[Ikalgo whimpers]

39
00:04:11,000 --> 00:04:13,000
Six seconds.

40
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:14,000
[Ikalgo whimpers]

41
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:32,000
and my favorite was the breathtaking
whiplash squid.

42
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:43,000
Octopi are ugly.

43
00:04:57,000 --> 00:05:01,000
[Killua thinking]
Yeah. I saw it in your eyes.

44
00:05:01,000 --> 00:05:05,000
[Ikalgo] I only hope
that in my next life,

45
00:05:05,000 --> 00:05:09,000
I will be reborn as a squid.

46
00:05:09,000 --> 00:05:11,000
[Killua gasps]

47
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:35,000
[Shark Ant growls]

48
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:38,000
-[gasps]
-[Killua gasps]

49
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:44,000
-Huh?
-[Shark Ant laughs]

50
00:05:44,000 --> 00:05:45,000
You lowered your guard!

51
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:48,000
I bet you didn't think fish
could jump, huh?

52
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:52,000
I'll crush you
and the rock behind you!

53
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:53,000
[gasps]

54
00:05:53,000 --> 00:05:55,000
[Flutter] Ikalgo, come in.

55
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:58,000
[Ikalgo] Uh, yes.
Th… The fight's not over yet.

56
00:05:58,000 --> 00:06:02,000
[Flutter] What's happening?
Has he used weapons, or special abilities?

57
00:06:02,000 --> 00:06:03,000
-[Ikalgo grunting]
-Ikalgo!

58
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,000
[Ikalgo] No.

59
00:06:10,000 --> 00:06:13,000
In fact,
he's been fighting with his bare hands.

60
00:06:15,000 --> 00:06:17,000
[Shark Ant] Aw, come on!
Scream a little.

61
00:06:17,000 --> 00:06:19,000
Otherwise, it's no fun, huh?

62
00:06:19,000 --> 00:06:23,000
Or are you in too much pain to talk, huh?

63
00:06:36,000 --> 00:06:38,000
You're right. He was scum!

64
00:06:38,000 --> 00:06:39,000
That's why he was the decoy!

65
00:06:44,000 --> 00:06:48,000
I did it, Sir Ortho!
I've attached the badge!

66
00:06:58,000 --> 00:07:02,000
Damn. The bleeding still won't stop.

67
00:07:07,000 --> 00:07:11,000
[Killua] Wait. Was that a digital sound
inside my head?

68
00:07:11,000 --> 00:07:14,000
[gasps]

69
00:07:16,000 --> 00:07:18,000
What?

70
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:20,000
A fish?

71
00:07:20,000 --> 00:07:22,000
But I'm not in the water!

72
00:07:23,000 --> 00:07:25,000
What in the hell is going on here?

73
00:07:25,000 --> 00:07:27,000
I didn't sense anything at all.

74
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:39,000
[gasps]

75
00:07:45,000 --> 00:07:46,000
This is bad.

76
00:07:46,000 --> 00:07:50,000
I don't have the slightest idea
where these attacks are coming from.

77
00:07:50,000 --> 00:07:52,000
[Sir Ortho laughs]

78
00:07:52,000 --> 00:07:55,000
A hundred and eight points!

79
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:05,000
Well, you'll figure it out

80
00:08:06,000 --> 00:08:08,000
if you can survive
long enough, anyway.

81
00:08:09,000 --> 00:08:10,000
[gasps]

82
00:08:11,000 --> 00:08:13,000
These fish are made from Nen.

83
00:08:13,000 --> 00:08:17,000
I should be able to sense them,
so why can't I?

84
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:20,000
Something is triggering them
from somewhere else.

85
00:08:20,000 --> 00:08:21,000
That has to be it!

86
00:08:22,000 --> 00:08:27,000
How else could I be attacked
by something I can't see, or even sense?

87
00:08:27,000 --> 00:08:29,000
[grunting]

88
00:08:40,000 --> 00:08:45,000
Now, then, have you determined
anything about these attacks?

89
00:08:45,000 --> 00:08:47,000
[Killua] It looks like
he can only materialize

90
00:08:48,000 --> 00:08:50,000
three fish at any one time.

91
00:08:50,000 --> 00:08:53,000
After that, the fish will disappear,

92
00:09:10,000 --> 00:09:13,000
That is correct,
but unfortunately for you,

93
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:16,000
figuring it out
isn't gonna help you much.

94
00:09:22,000 --> 00:09:25,000
so blocking them is impossible.

95
00:09:25,000 --> 00:09:27,000
[laughs]

96
00:09:27,000 --> 00:09:30,000
By the way, your left shoulder
is worth 54 points.

97
00:09:31,000 --> 00:09:33,000
I have a special dartboard, you see.

98
00:09:38,000 --> 00:09:40,000
Like for example…

99
00:09:40,000 --> 00:09:41,000
[Killua grunts]

100
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:44,000
[Sir Ortho]
Your right elbow is 27 points.

101
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:47,000
Your right hand is 18 points.

102
00:09:48,000 --> 00:09:51,000
[laughs] Ninety-nine points.

103
00:09:52,000 --> 00:09:54,000
Hey, what's wrong?

104
00:09:54,000 --> 00:09:57,000
I can't hear your screams.

105
00:10:03,000 --> 00:10:04,000
Triple six!

106
00:10:05,000 --> 00:10:07,000
Four!

107
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:08,000
Thirteen!

108
00:10:09,000 --> 00:10:11,000
[Lady Ortho clapping]
Way to go, brother.

109
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:14,000
That was incredible.
You're on a roll now.

110
00:10:14,000 --> 00:10:16,000
[Sir Ortho] Well, naturally.

111
00:10:16,000 --> 00:10:18,000
Our lives are on the line.

112
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:22,000
[narrator] This is how the Ortho
siblings' power works.

113
00:10:22,000 --> 00:10:24,000
The younger sister creates a Nen pin,

114
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:45,000
There is no way
to avoid this attack.

115
00:10:45,000 --> 00:10:48,000
That is because,
until they've hit the target's body,

116
00:10:48,000 --> 00:10:50,000
the Nen needlefish do not exist,

117
00:11:03,000 --> 00:11:06,000
[narrator] Of course,
the siblings do incur some risk.

118
00:11:07,000 --> 00:11:10,000
Once the pin activates,
they are invincible.

119
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:14,000
But if the brother misses
on the final throw and busts…

120
00:11:16,000 --> 00:11:17,000
[Killua grunts]

121
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:19,000
[narrator] …all the damage
the target has taken

122
00:11:19,000 --> 00:11:21,000
will transfer back to the siblings.

123
00:11:48,000 --> 00:11:50,000
and beg for his life,
it would certainly help me focus,

124
00:11:51,000 --> 00:11:52,000
and I could be far more effective.

125
00:11:52,000 --> 00:11:56,000
But if he were to say something
like, "Please hurry up, and kill me,"

126
00:11:56,000 --> 00:11:59,000
or if he played the nihilist hero
and said,

127
00:12:08,000 --> 00:12:10,000
I would rather he die

128
00:12:10,000 --> 00:12:13,000
while dreading the exact moment
when the final shot will come.

129
00:12:13,000 --> 00:12:16,000
[grunts]

130
00:12:31,000 --> 00:12:32,000
[gasps]

131
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:36,000
I've lost way too much blood already.

132
00:13:00,000 --> 00:13:01,000
[Sir Ortho] Right calf!

133
00:13:12,000 --> 00:13:14,000
Leave it to me.

134
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:42,000
You see?

135
00:13:42,000 --> 00:13:44,000
Bravo! [laughs]

136
00:13:44,000 --> 00:13:46,000
-Yay!
-Yay!

137
00:13:46,000 --> 00:13:48,000
[both] Yay!

138
00:13:48,000 --> 00:13:51,000
Mwah! You're the best big brother
in the whole wide world!

139
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:55,000
-I'm going to go check his corpse!
-I'll come with you.

140
00:13:55,000 --> 00:13:59,000
We should share some of the meat
with Coburn as a reward.

141
00:14:03,000 --> 00:14:05,000
[Gon gobbling]

142
00:14:07,000 --> 00:14:09,000
You're not eating?

143
00:14:11,000 --> 00:14:13,000
Whoa!

144
00:14:31,000 --> 00:14:32,000
[Gon] Isn't that enough?

145
00:14:32,000 --> 00:14:34,000
Hell, no! Are you kidding me?

146
00:14:41,000 --> 00:14:43,000
So you were lying to me?

147
00:14:43,000 --> 00:14:46,000
[sputters]
I'm not like those other guys!

148
00:14:56,000 --> 00:14:59,000
He's strong, but he's just a kid.

149
00:14:59,000 --> 00:15:04,000
I'm putting my life in the hands
of a little boy who doesn't have a clue.

150
00:15:04,000 --> 00:15:08,000
And besides, if you're lying,
it'll be a lot easier for me.

151
00:15:13,000 --> 00:15:16,000
I could just kill you, you know.

152
00:15:16,000 --> 00:15:18,000
[dramatic music playing]

153
00:15:18,000 --> 00:15:21,000
[Meleoron]
This kid, the look in his eyes,

154
00:15:29,000 --> 00:15:32,000
There's something special
about this kid.

155
00:15:32,000 --> 00:15:36,000
I can't even tell how much power
he really has.

156
00:15:38,000 --> 00:15:41,000
[Sir Ortho laughs]

157
00:15:41,000 --> 00:15:44,000
You hit him right in the forehead.
What a shot.

158
00:15:45,000 --> 00:15:48,000
[Sir Ortho] Sir Flutter,
we've taken out the target.

159
00:15:48,000 --> 00:15:50,000
[Flutter] Really? Excellent.

160
00:15:51,000 --> 00:15:55,000
I'll be sure to inform Sir Leol
that a promotion is in order.

161
00:16:21,000 --> 00:16:24,000
An octopus's suction cup.

162
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:26,000
[gasps] No way.

163
00:16:26,000 --> 00:16:28,000
But how in the world
did you manage to do that?

164
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:32,000
No, what I mean is my…
my darts are perfect!

165
00:16:33,000 --> 00:16:35,000
They're completely
impossible to block!

166
00:16:36,000 --> 00:16:38,000
Yeah, except I didn't block it.

167
00:16:38,000 --> 00:16:40,000
I just grabbed it, that's all.

168
00:16:41,000 --> 00:16:46,000
I waited 'til the last moment,
right when it materialized at my head.

169
00:16:46,000 --> 00:16:47,000
[gasps]

170
00:16:53,000 --> 00:16:56,000
I had plenty of time
to break the fish's beak,

171
00:16:56,000 --> 00:17:00,000
take a sucker,
and put it right at the end of it.

172
00:17:05,000 --> 00:17:06,000
are fast enough to catch a dart.

173
00:17:06,000 --> 00:17:09,000
Not you, not anyone!
Do you hear me, brat?

174
00:17:09,000 --> 00:17:10,000
[Killua] Yeah, you're right.

175
00:17:11,000 --> 00:17:13,000
If I hadn't known
where the dart was gonna be,

176
00:17:13,000 --> 00:17:15,000
I wouldn't have been able to.

177
00:17:15,000 --> 00:17:17,000
But fortunately for me,

178
00:17:17,000 --> 00:17:20,000
I knew just where it would hit,
and I was dead right.

179
00:17:51,000 --> 00:17:52,000
Don't you remember?

180
00:17:53,000 --> 00:17:55,000
The first throw you had
was a double four.

181
00:18:03,000 --> 00:18:06,000
a sign you were confident
in your skill.

182
00:18:06,000 --> 00:18:11,000
Players like that will always play
by the official rules.

183
00:18:11,000 --> 00:18:13,000
If they're confident and trained,

184
00:18:48,000 --> 00:18:51,000
process it, and transmit
a command to his hand,

185
00:18:51,000 --> 00:18:54,000
he programmed the aura
around his hand

186
00:18:54,000 --> 00:18:56,000
to send a signal
directly to his muscles,

187
00:19:12,000 --> 00:19:14,000
This is what happens
when you get cocky…

188
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:15,000
[Killua thinking] Or was I seven?

189
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:18,000
-…are so stupid!
-[Killua] Doesn't really matter.

190
00:19:18,000 --> 00:19:21,000
-Shouldn't have talked so long.
-[Orthos arguing]

191
00:19:21,000 --> 00:19:22,000
Gotta hurry up.

192
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:31,000
Huh?

193
00:19:37,000 --> 00:19:41,000
I can't get my body to move.

194
00:19:41,000 --> 00:19:44,000
Is this really happening?

195
00:19:55,000 --> 00:20:00,000
It almost feels like
I'm taking a warm bath.

196
00:20:13,000 --> 00:20:17,000
Damn it. Now I feel cold.

197
00:20:18,000 --> 00:20:20,000
That's just great.

198
00:20:30,000 --> 00:20:34,000
Am I going to die here?

199
00:20:36,000 --> 00:20:40,000
Gon, I'm sorry.

200
00:21:10,000 --> 00:21:12,000
[Killua] What are you doing?

201
00:21:12,000 --> 00:21:14,000
Hey, isn't it obvious?

202
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:16,000
I'm turning traitor, you dummy!

203
00:21:16,000 --> 00:21:18,000
Not cool, I know. Now stop talking!

204
00:21:18,000 --> 00:21:21,000
Look, I know an unlicensed doctor.

205
00:21:21,000 --> 00:21:23,000
We can take
the underground current.

206
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:26,000
Won't be long, so hang on!

207
00:21:26,000 --> 00:21:29,000
[Killua] Are you an idiot? Come on.

208
00:21:29,000 --> 00:21:32,000
I spared your life.

209
00:21:33,000 --> 00:21:36,000
Now they're gonna
come after you, too.

210
00:21:36,000 --> 00:21:38,000
Yeah, don't you think I know that?

211
00:21:38,000 --> 00:21:40,000
Don't ask me why I'm doing this.

212
00:21:44,000 --> 00:21:45,000
All I know is this.

213
00:21:56,000 --> 00:21:58,000
I can't stand by while you die!

214
00:22:02,000 --> 00:22:04,000
I'm gonna save you!

215
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:07,000
[echoing] Don't you die on me!

216
00:22:09,000 --> 00:22:11,000
[closing theme music playing]

217
00:22:11,000 --> 00:22:14,000
[singer singing in Japanese]

218
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:33,000
[Gon] Next time,
"power and games."

219
00:23:33,000 --> 00:23:34,000
[Meleoron exhales]

220
00:23:34,000 --> 00:23:37,000
[Gon] If you smoke,
your teeth will turn black.

221
00:23:37,000 --> 00:23:39,000
[Meleoron] I'm a chameleon,
so I don't have teeth.

222
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:45,000
[singer singing in Japanese]
